            "notes": "# \u26a0\ufe0f PICK [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) AND [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) NOW!!\n*Read round 5 and 6 tips to understand why.*\n\n## TIP\nI recommend you to use [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).\nWhy? Because this item give you a very good sustain and avoid you to be one shot in most cases. Also, it cancels the damage taken during the 3s when you use a suzu on yourself or when you tp. So you have an overall very good damage reduction.\n\n## POWER\n- [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) \n\n## CORE\n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n- [Ry\u014dta's Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164)\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)\n- [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n- [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f)\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
